---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import CtaBand from '../components/CtaBand.astro';
---
<Base title="How we work" description="Plan-first, AI-assisted migration: discover, plan, build, validate, then a controlled go-live with close support.">
  <section class="section on-dark">
    <div class="container narrow">
      <p class="eyebrow">How we work</p>
      <h1>No surprises. No hidden risk. No doubt about who is accountable.</h1>
      <p class="lead">Every migration follows the same repeatable process, supported by AI tools, so you always know what is happening, what comes next and how risk is being managed.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <ol class="steps">
        <li>
          <h3>Discover</h3>
          <p>AI tools help us map everything your current platform does: every connection, data mapping, business rule and dependency.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3>Plan</h3>
          <p>We agree a detailed plan: the phases, how each go-live will work, how to step back if needed, who owns what and how success is measured.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3>Build</h3>
          <p>We rebuild each connection on Microsoft Azure, set up from repeatable scripts with security built in from the start.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3>Validate</h3>
          <p>Automated tests compare old and new behaviour, so you have evidence before anything goes live.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3>Go live &amp; support</h3>
          <p>A controlled switchover with a way back if needed, then close support until each phase is stable.</p>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section tint">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="narrow">
        <p class="eyebrow">Governance</p>
        <h2>You stay in control at every stage</h2>
        <p>Progress, risks and decisions are visible throughout. Here is how accountability works in practice.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-3" style="margin-top:32px">
        <div class="card">
          <h3>People approve every stage</h3>
          <p>The work passes four approval gates, and every release is a human decision. AI tools never put changes live on their own.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Fixed price, phase by phase</h3>
          <p>You agree the price of each phase before it starts, so you always know what you are committing to.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>A way back at every go-live</h3>
          <p>Each switchover can be rolled back in one step. Ask us about our safe-cutover guarantee.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Controlled AI access</h3>
          <p>Each of our AI agents has its own identity and clearly limited permissions. None has unmanaged access to your data or systems.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Handed over, not left behind</h3>
          <p>At the end, we retire the old platform and hand everything over to your team, documented and tested.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Change at your pace</h3>
          <p>Migration speed is usually set by how quickly your organisation can absorb change. We plan around that.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CtaBand />
</Base>
